future options for short-term stability, it stops paying the distinction cost, it completely ignores

44:48.020 --> 44:52.780
its mathematical blind spots, and it watches its admissibility manifold shrink to zero.

44:53.000 --> 44:57.100
Well, I promised at the beginning of this deep dive that we were going to rewire how you perceive

